<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Stay connected! We invite you to download and install our new Flywire Conference mobile app via the <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/flywire-conference/id1667643136?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><u>Apple store</u></a></span> or <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.flywire.ahapp&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><u>Google Play store</u></a></span> to:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ol style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Find up-to-date agenda, speaker, and venue information</span></li> 
