<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">This year’s conference is being hosted at the <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://lansdowneresort.com?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>Lansdowne Resort</u></strong></a></span>&nbsp;located at 44050 Woodridge Pkwy in Leesburg, Virginia, conveniently near three airports:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Dulles International Airport - 12.5 miles / ~20 minutes</span></li> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Ronald Reagan Washington National Airport - 36.5 miles / ~45 minutes</span></li> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Baltimore/Washington International Airport - 65.9 miles / ~1 hour</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Check in is at 4:00 pm, and check out is at 11:00 am. If you arrive prior to </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">4:00 pm, and your room is ready, the hotel will check you in early. Please note this is not guaranteed. If you need a late check out, please contact the front desk to see if they can accommodate.</span></p> </td> 
