<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px; color: #0f476b;">Agenda</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">We have an exciting <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://fusion.flywire.com/event/64962232-142e-4223-acb4-7a9cfb76b730/speakers?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>speaker lineup</u></strong></a></span> of clients and FlyMates hosting an action-packed agenda of <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://fusion.flywire.com/event/64962232-142e-4223-acb4-7a9cfb76b730/agenda?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>insightful sessions</u></strong></a></span>. We will be officially kicking off the conference with our <span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Welcome Reception &amp; Spirit</strong> <strong>Night</strong></span> at 6:30 pm on Monday, featuring our <span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Taste of Virginia</strong></span>. On Tuesday and Wednesday, we’ll gather for breakfast and networking starting at 7:45 am in Riverside Hearth with <span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>general sessions</strong></span> starting at 8:45 am in the Lansdowne Ballroom. Breakout sessions will take place in the Faulkner and Bacon rooms on Tuesday following lunch in Riverside (12:30-1:30 pm) and during a portion of Wednesday morning. </span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">See our <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://fusion.flywire.com/event/64962232-142e-4223-acb4-7a9cfb76b730/agenda?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>full agenda</u></strong></a></span> to learn more.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
