<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px; color: #0f476b;">Meals</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">We’ve got you covered when it comes to meals during the conference! All meals are included—including our celebratory <span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Awards Dinner</strong></span> on Tuesday evening in the Clubhouse Ballroom.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Fusion wraps up early Wednesday afternoon, and we’ll have box lunches ready for anyone who can’t stick around for lunch in Riverside Hearth.</span></p> </td> 
