<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px; color: #0f476b;">Sponsor Forum</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">We are so grateful for you, our sponsors. The <span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Sponsor Forum</strong></span> is located right outside the Lansdowne Ballroom. It’s the perfect spot for attendees to take a break, grab a coffee or snack, and chat with you, our amazing partners.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">For those sponsors who will be exhibiting, your sponsorship includes one 6-foot exhibit table and two chairs. Displays should not extend outside of your assigned area. A tent card with your company name will be placed on each assigned exhibit table, and our schedule follows:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><em><span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Setup</strong></span>:</em></span></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Monday, October 20</strong><strong>:</strong></span> 12:00 pm - 5:00 pm</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong><em>NOTE: All sponsor tables need to be set up by 7:30 am on Tuesday.</em></strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><strong><em>Exhibit Hours:</em></strong></span></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><strong>Tuesday, October 21: </strong><span style="color: #223341;">8:00 am - 5:00 pm</span><strong><br /></strong></span></li> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><strong>Wednesday, October 22: </strong><span style="color: #223341;">8:00 am - 12:30 pm</span></span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><strong><em>Teardown:</em></strong></span></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="color: #0f476b; font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><strong>Wednesday, October 22: </strong><span style="color: #223341;">1:00 pm - 3:00 pm</span></span></li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
