</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;"><em><strong>!! IMPORTANT !! If you haven’t already sent over tracking details for any shipments for swag bag inclusions or for the raffle, please send tracking number, number of boxes and item details to </strong></em></span><span style="color: #147bd1;"><em><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="mailto:victoria@kvtevents.co"><strong><u>victoria@kvtevents.co</u></strong></a></em></span><span style="color: #0f476b;"><em><strong> as soon as possible.</strong> </em></span></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #223341; font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">If you’d like to verify receipt of packages, please contact the Lansdowne Conference Concierge directly at (703) 729-4107 and be prepared to provide date, method of shipment and tracking number.</span></p> </td> 
