<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px; color: #0f476b;">Outbound Shipments</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">For outbound shipments, each sponsor is responsible for boxing up outgoing packages or repacking pallets/crates. Please have all boxes labeled with the correct account number to be charged. If using a freight carrier, please have three copies of the Bill of Lading. Each sponsor is responsible for boxing up outgoing packages or repacking pallets/crates.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
