<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px; color: #0f476b;">Activities &amp; What to Wear</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Virginia typically experiences crisp, pleasant autumn weather with cooler, drier air and vibrant foliage this time of year. The dress code for the conference is business casual, and we recommend you dress in layers. We have a couple of fun activities where you might want to bring some special attire:</span></p> 
<ol style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Welcome Reception &amp; Spirit Night:</strong></span> Show your spirit at our conference kickoff on Monday evening, which will take place both inside and outside (weather permitting) on the Terrace. We encourage you to wear your organization’s colors and/or branded clothing to add to the networking fun!</span></li> 
<li style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>Dinner &amp; Awards Ceremony:</strong></span> Celebrate collaborative success with an opportunity to dress fun and festive, or in cocktail attire, on Tuesday for a fun evening. </span></li> 
</ol> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 21px; color: #0f476b;">Social Networking</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 23px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">In addition to networking at the conference, we invite you to stay connected online by utilizing <span style="color: #0f476b;"><strong>#FlywireFusion25</strong></span> when sharing your experience on social channels! Get started now by sharing the image below to let your network know you’ll be attending Flywire Fusion.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">If you have questions, we invite you to visit our <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="https://fusion.flywire.com/event/64962232-142e-4223-acb4-7a9cfb76b730/faq?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><strong><u>FAQ page</u></strong></a></span> or email us at <span style="color: #147bd1;"><a style="color: #147bd1;" href="mailto:victoria@kvtevents.co"><strong><u>victoria@kvtevents.co</u></strong></a></span>.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 23px;">Safe travels to Virginia! We can’t wait to see you!</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-2olp7jlzrkp0a" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/st2hkncila/en_us/images/68e814da73d3c-1760040154.4744.jpg" alt="Flywire Fusion Attendee" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
